    rdfs:label "Candidate dataset: Honeycomb X-ray microscopy" ;
    dct:description "X-ray volumes and reconstructions of Apis mellifera comb from which prism and, where the base is in frame, rhomb angles can be measured" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.z8w9ghxmw> .
